{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/extras/LUIv01_logo_all.gif?t=1745407316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 29-year-old ordinary guy, Ethan Syu works as an on-site computer engineer by day and runs a low-traffic personal video channel by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, on his way to a filming location, he gets into an accident. The next day, he wakes up to find a strange user interface popping up in his vision, showing what seems to be the affection levels of certain people around him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the numbers fluctuate, Ethan Syu\u2019s once ordinary life is about to change forever\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/extras/web_v02_SJY.png?t=1745407316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/extras/web_v02_YCS.png?t=1745407316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/extras/web_v02_JJS.png?t=1745407316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/extras/web_v02_JSY.png?t=1745407316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460120?t=1745407316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745407316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460120/13b86812661831e5dfedac6e0c8571ed6f8ba945/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745407316","capsule_image